# Database Connection URL (Supabase, Vercel Postgres, Neon, Cloud SQL, Railway)
# Supabase Format: postgres://postgres.[PROJECT_REF]:[PASSWORD]@aws-0-[REGION].pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres?pgbouncer=true
